{"candidateAnswer":"She hasn't done it yet","evidence":"[D10:20 | 5:35 pm on 22 March, 2023] Jolene: Definitely! I've been gathering information, watching videos, and I even got a beginners' guide to surfing. Just need to find the right time and place to get a lesson.\n[D29:26 | 1:24 pm on 17 September, 2023] Jolene: How cool! But I never decided to try it.\n[D29:30 | 1:24 pm on 17 September, 2023] Jolene: Just started learning, but haven't gone yet. Want to come with me sometime?","itemId":"urn:uuid:028dbd09-731e-549f-a423-e57a2b456d01","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:90423df33ded3ba8586507f3b21ac5839b21fba8d7c206ca9e81db61afdb0af5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Has Jolene tried surfing?","referenceAnswer":"no","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"90423df33ded3ba8586507f3b21ac5839b21fba8d7c206ca9e81db61afdb0af5"}}]}